      "$kind": "problem",
      "Header": "double for money",
      "Intro": "Binary floating point can\u0027t represent most decimal fractions.",
      "RowsText": "0.1 \u002B 0.2 | 0.30000000000000004\n0.1 \u002B 0.2 == 0.3 | False\n100 / 3 \u00D7 3 | 99.99",
      "BulletsText": "Tiny errors accumulate\nRounding differs per layer\nRemainders silently vanish",
      "Dir": "Auto",
