      "$kind": "solution",
      "Header": "decimal \u002B one policy",
      "Intro": "Exact decimals, explicit rounding, remainders allocated.",
      "CodeLinesText": "0.1m \u002B 0.2m | // 0.3\nRound(2.5m, 0, AwayFromZero) | // 3",
      "BulletsText": "decimal(18,2) in the database\nOne rounding rule, in one place\nParts always sum to the total",
